# Super Mario World (USA): the standard layer-3 font, from
# tables/fonts/standard.asm in the SMW disassembly. Bit 7 marks the last
# tile of a message-box line; the entries from $80 up are those tiles.
# $32-$37 and $38-$3C are the cursive glyphs ILLUSI and YELLOW; $60-$63
# are the 2x2 picture that signs the Yoshi's House message.
